WEBVTT

00:15:29.719 --> 00:15:31.964
Hello, Santa Claus. (Laughter)

00:15:31.964 --> 00:15:41.461
I mean, another way to think about this is,

00:15:41.461 --> 00:15:43.494
which would you rather have,

00:15:43.494 --> 00:15:46.523
a kid with obesity, diabetes, shortened lifespan,

00:15:46.523 --> 00:15:48.055
all the things that go with it,

00:15:48.055 --> 00:15:51.071
or a kid with one little extra bit of false memory?

00:15:51.071 --> 00:15:54.462
I know what I would choose for a kid of mine.

00:15:54.462 --> 00:15:58.439
But maybe my work has made me different from most people.

00:15:58.439 --> 00:16:00.518
Most people cherish their memories,